.TH HIO 1 "" "HARDWARIO Monitor @HIO_VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
hio \- HARDWARIO Monitor command-line interface
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hio
[\fIoptions\fR] \fIcommand\fR ...
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B hio
is the command-line interface of HARDWARIO Monitor: console, logs and flashing of HARDWARIO
devices (such as CHESTER) through a SEGGER J-Link probe or Bluetooth, diagnostics
(\fBhio doctor\fR, \fBhio diag report\fR), the update check (\fBhio update check\fR) and the
MCP server (\fBhio mcp\fR). Every command has \fB\-\-help\fR; \fB\-\-json\fR gives
machine-readable output.
.PP
SEGGER J-Link Software 8.00 or newer must be installed separately.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Print the help and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-json
Machine-readable output: one JSON envelope per line on stdout.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR hio-monitor (1),
https://github.com/hardwario/hio-monitor
